// Workspace file for the repository root.
//
// The Go module lives in backend/, not at the repository root, because this
// repo also holds the Next.js web app, the Tauri POS and the design docs.
// Without this file gopls opens the root as an "AdHoc" view, sees no module,
// and cannot resolve symbols inside backend/ — which silently disables Serena's
// symbolic tools even though the language server appears to start correctly.
//
// It also gives a home to the desktop and web tooling later without another
// round of editor configuration.

go 1.26

use ./backend
